5ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.6ex\" height=\"1.645ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2475 727\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(888,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1417,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2177,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D459\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D459\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> completely dissociates in both the solvents. \n<br><br><img class=\"question-image\" src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/a4zxwiNxsEMxqMSTk/fORlQGNRHs5kAW7yfhoQ2YgUuAv83/7qEGfqlVPhGA00jaCDVVLK/image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2018 Paper 1 Offline Chemistry - Solutions Question 20 English\"> \n<br><br>On addition of equal number of moles of a non-volatile solute <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.459ex\" height=\"1.645ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 645 727\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D446\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D446\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> in equal amount (in <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.464ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.265ex\" height=\"2.034ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 1001 899\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D458\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D458\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(521,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D454\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D454\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) of these solvents, the elevation of boiling point of solvent <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.928ex\" height=\"1.545ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 852 683\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D44B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44B\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is three times that of solvent <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.002ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.726ex\" height=\"1.543ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 763 682\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D44C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44C\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>. Solute <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.459ex\" height=\"1.645ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 645 727\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D446\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D446\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is known to undergo dimerization in these solvents.  If the degree of dimerization is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.891ex\" height=\"1.579ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -676 1278 698\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> in solvent <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.002ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.726ex\" height=\"1.543ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 763 682\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D44C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44C\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, the degree of dimerization in solvent <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.928ex\" height=\"1.545ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 852 683\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D44B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44B\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is ___________. ",
      "options": [],
      "correct_options": [],
      "explanation": "<p>For solvent X, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.885ex\" height=\"1.62ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 833 716\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>T<sub>bX</sub> = K<sub>bX</sub> m <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.054ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.262ex\" height=\"1.242ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -525 1000 549\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"21D2\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-21D2\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> 2 = 2K<sub>bX</sub> m ..... (1)</p>\n<p>For solvent Y, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.885ex\" height=\"1.62ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 833 716\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>T<sub>bY</sub> = K<sub>bY</sub> m <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.054ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.262ex\" height=\"1.242ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -525 1000 549\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"21D2\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-21D2\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> 1 = 2K<sub>bY</sub> m ..... (2)</p>\n<p>Dividing Eq. (1) by Eq. (2), we get</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.033ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.084ex\" height=\"3.147ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -934.5 3573.1 1391.1\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(220,451.6) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(882,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D44F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(429,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(242.3,-345) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(882,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D44F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(429,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44C\"></use></g></g></g></g></g><rect width=\"1499.5\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2017.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3073.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>After adding solute S, molality is the same for both solutions.</p>\n<p>Dimerisation is a association property. And for dimerisation van't Hoff factor</p>\n<p>i = 1 + <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.798ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.75ex\" height=\"2.755ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -864.9 4309.4 1217.7\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(0 -0.5)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-SO-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(458,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(255.4,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45B\"></use></g><rect width=\"624.3\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1086.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2086.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3044.7,0) translate(0 -0.5)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-SO-29\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"t